# Glossary

**Prerequisites:** none.
**Kind:** reference companion.

Terms appear here when a reader meets them on more than one path. Canonical
behavior stays in [reference](/docs/reference/).

| Term | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| Component | A PascalCase `@component` that lowers to a pure Roc `Html` function. |
| Standalone app | A `.rocci` module with `@context` / `@init` / `@view` that `rocci run` compiles into a generated server. |
| Custom app | A directory with authored `main.roc` that reuses `.rocci` modules. |
| Patch | A one-shot HTML fragment from `@patch`; Datastar morphs the acting tab. |
| Command | A `@command` handler that returns Roc data: empty SSE to Datastar, JSON to other clients. |
| Live | A module-level `@live` render that generates `GET /sse` for shared HTML updates. |
| Datastar | Browser transport for intent and morphing. Not a client application framework. |
| Fixture | `@fixture` preview data for `rocci view` / `browse`. |
| Lowering | Translating template regions to ordinary Roc (`Html.*`, camelCase functions). |
| Source map | Segments that map generated Roc back to `.rocci` spans. |
| Preview | The Tao/Wry window that loads the same local HTTP origin as a browser. |
| `rocci browse` | Component gallery. |
| `rocci-browser` | Project picker host. Not part of the `rocci` CLI reference. |
| Rocdown | Separate Markdown-first document product. Not part of the Rocci learning path. |
| Loopback | `127.0.0.1` / `localhost` only in `rocci.toml` `[http].host`. |
| `??` default | Experimental field default in `.rocci` params; stripped for current Roc nightly. |

**Related:** [Status](/docs/status/) for current / experimental / planned / removed.
